{
  "name": "dsh-session-bridge",
  "version": "0.6.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Session bridge for DeepSeek Harness: project-grouped session manager (batch export/import, preview, duplicate audit, trash, move between projects) and import from Claude Code, Codex, zcode, opencode, Goose, Zed, Vibe. | 会话桥：按 project 分组的会话管理（批量导入导出 / 预览 / 去重 / 回收站 / 移动归属）+ 多 Agent 来源导入。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ]
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "session",
    "export",
    "import",
    "backup",
    "dedupe"
  ],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": ">=4.0.0-rc <5"
  }
}
